OL,3,GNEWSAThe moment sailor is rescued from
OL,4,Ayacht as it sinks
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootage shows the moment a lone sailor
OL,7,Fwas rescued just before his yacht sank
OL,8,Fin the Bristol Channel.
OL,10,FRNLI volunteer crews were called from
OL,11,FPorthcawl and The Mumbles after being
OL,12,Falerted to the vessel which had run
OL,13,Faground.
OL,15,FA lifeboat was launched just after
OL,16,F15:00 BST on 28 August towards the
OL,17,Fsandbank.
OL,19,FAndrew Walmsley, from Porthcawl RNLI,
OL,20,Fcommended the crew for doing a "great
OL,21,Fjob" in difficult conditions as time
OL,22,Fwas of the essence.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
